---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="自研项目 - 庄谷 (charmlynn)"
  description="庄谷 (charmlynn) 的自研产品与开源工具，包括面向开发者的本地优先 AI 知识库 SaveAnswer 等。"
>
  <div class="space-y-8">
    <div class="space-y-2 border-b border-stone-200/80 pb-4">
      <h1 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-stone-900">自研项目</h1>
      <p class="text-stone-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
        平时根据自己的痛点与真实工作流打磨的工具产品。推崇本地优先（Local-first）、数据私有与极致效能。
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Project 1: SaveAnswer -->
    <article class="space-y-4 rounded-xl border border-stone-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-xs">
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center justify-between gap-3">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <img
            src="/saveanswer/assets/icon.png"
            alt="SaveAnswer Icon"
            class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg border border-stone-200 p-0.5"
          />
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-stone-900">SaveAnswer</h2>
              <span class="text-xs font-mono text-stone-400">v1.1.0</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-xs text-stone-500">面向开发者的本地优先 AI 知识库 Chrome 扩展</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-xs">
          <a
            href="/saveanswer/"
            class="text-blue-600 hover:underline font-medium"
          >
            访问推广主页 →
          </a>
          <a
            href="https://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/saveanswer-save-ai-answer/iminapemlncanmmaadedieifgkaeoljm"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-stone-900 text-white hover:bg-stone-800 transition-colors"
          >
            Chrome 商店安装
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed">
        原生内嵌 ChatGPT、Claude、DeepSeek、Gemini、通义千问、Grok、豆包等模型网页端。支持 420px 弹窗敏捷秒查、三栏桌面工作台深度研读与直写本地 Obsidian。零云端服务器，数据 100% 掌握在自己手中。
      </p>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-2 text-xs text-stone-500 pt-1">
        <div class="p-2.5 rounded bg-stone-50 border border-stone-100">
          <strong class="text-stone-800 block mb-0.5">多模型一键采集</strong>
          <span>对话末尾原生注入采集按钮，提取 Markdown 与会话上下文。</span>
        </div>
        <div class="p-2.5 rounded bg-stone-50 border border-stone-100">
          <strong class="text-stone-800 block mb-0.5">直写 Obsidian Vault</strong>
          <span>浏览器本地文件接口直写本地笔记，无中间第三方服务器。</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- Project 2: charmlynn.github.io -->
    <article class="space-y-2 rounded-xl border border-stone-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-xs">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
        <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-stone-900">charmlynn.github.io</h2>
        <a
          href="https://github.com/charmlynn/charmlynn.github.io"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="text-xs text-stone-400 hover:text-stone-700 font-mono"
        >
          GitHub 源码 →
        </a>
      </div>
      <p class="text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed">
        个人极简网站与博客系统。基于 Astro 7 + Tailwind CSS v4 构建，纯静态输出，零运行时 JS 负担，部署于 GitHub Pages 并完整承载 SaveAnswer 二级落地页。
      </p>
    </article>
  </div>
</Layout>
